sequenceDiagram
    participant H as Host
    participant E0 as ASIC 0 Ethernet tile
    participant E1 as ASIC 1 Ethernet tile
    participant T as Remote target tile
    H->>E0: write command payload
    H->>E0: fence, then publish SQ index
    E0->>E1: route across Ethernet
    E1->>T: forward over local NoC
    T-->>E1: response
    E1-->>E0: return across Ethernet
    E0-->>H: publish CQ entry
    H->>E0: consume, then advance CQ index
